            'liq.ui.diameter_at_nozzle_throat_minimum_area': 'Nozzle throat diameter (mm). HRMA sizes the throat itself from thrust, chamber pressure and c* (mass balance) and publishes it in the results, so the field opens empty. A value you enter changes no calculation: it is only compared with the solved throat (the result shows the solver value next to your entry and flags a deviation above 20 %). Accepted 1-3000 mm.',
            'liq.ui.diameter_of_fuel_injection_orifices_smaller': 'Fuel orifice diameter (mm). HRMA sizes the orifices from flow, pressure drop, Cd and element count and publishes them, so the field opens empty. A value you enter changes no calculation: it is only compared with the solver value (deviation above 20 % is flagged). Accepted 0.05-50 mm.',
            'liq.ui.diameter_of_oxidizer_injection_orifices_sized': 'Oxidizer orifice diameter (mm). HRMA sizes the orifices from flow, pressure drop, Cd and element count and publishes them, so the field opens empty. A value you enter changes no calculation: it is only compared with the solver value (deviation above 20 % is flagged). Accepted 0.05-50 mm.',
