            'liq.ui.engine_thrust_divided_by_engine_mass': 'Target engine thrust-to-weight. HRMA computes the engine T/W from its own dry-mass estimate and publishes it, so the field opens empty. A value you enter changes no calculation: it is only compared with the computed T/W (deviation above 20 % is flagged). Accepted 1-500.',
