            'liq.ui.preburner_type_tip': 'Staged combustion runs its preburner either fuel-rich (RS-25, RD-0120) or oxidizer-rich (RD-180, NK-33). This sets the turbine drive gas and the pump pressure ladder. Full-flow staged combustion uses both and needs no choice here.',
