            'liq.ui.closeout_material': 'Closeout Material',
            'liq.ui.closeout_material_tip': 'Material of the closeout: the outer shell that covers the cooling channels of a regenerative wall and carries the coolant pressure (NASA SP-8087: electroformed or brazed closure). Changes the closeout hoop check (yield at the closeout temperature, the highest coolant temperature) and, when Closeout Thickness is empty, the sized closeout thickness and the chamber mass; it does not change the thermal chain (the liner, Chamber Material, is the hot-gas wall). Empty: HRMA default Inconel 718, stated in the result. Shown with Regenerative cooling only.',
