            'liq.ui.number_of_start_stop_cycles_before': 'Number of start/stop cycles before refurbishment. Reusable engines need higher life. Expendable: 1-2 cycles, Reusable booster: 10-100 cycles, Spacecraft: 50-1000 cycles.',
