            'liq.ui.oxidizer_dynamic_viscosity_at_operating_temperat': 'Oxidizer dynamic viscosity at operating temperature. LOX: 0.00019, N2O4: 0.00042. Higher viscosity increases injection pressure requirements and affects atomization quality. Left blank, the value is auto-filled from the propellant table when the state solution resolves; if it does not resolve, the field stays empty. Accepted range: 1e-7 to 10 Pa·s (server band; outside it the request is rejected with a named 422).',
