            'liq.ui.pressure_at_turbopump_exit_or_tank': 'Pressure-fed cycle: the tank pressure (bar). HRMA sizes the tanks and the feed-line and valve budget from it and checks it against the pressure the chamber needs (Pc + injector drop + cooling-jacket and line losses); a lower value is refused by name and the required minimum is stated. Left blank in a pressure-fed cycle, the request is refused by name (no tank pressure is assumed). Not used in pump-fed (turbopump) cycles: the field is hidden there and not sent. Accepted 1-1000 bar.',
