            'solid.ui.bulk_density_of_the_solid_propellant': 'Bulk density ρp of the cast propellant in kg/m³. It sets the propellant mass of the grain, so the burn time, total impulse and the mass flow that sizes the throat change with it. Picking a catalogue record fills it with the record value (see the catalogue row); the value you type here is sent and used. Blank: the selected record\'s density is used. Accepted range 500-3000 kg/m³.',
