            'solid.ui.chemical_name_and_formulation_of_the': 'Label only: a free-text name for this propellant that is printed in the results, reports and the saved project. It does NOT select the propellant and changes no number - the identity is the "Propellant (catalogue record)" selector above. Picking a catalogue record fills it with the record name (unless you typed your own label). Blank: the results show no propellant label.',
            'solid.ui.closure_bolt_class': 'Closure Bolt Class',
