            'solid.ui.closure_mass': 'Closure Mass',
            'solid.ui.coefficient_for_burn_rate_enhancement_at': 'Erosive burning coefficient k of the mass-flux law (dimensionless here; the solver multiplies the base rate by 1 + k·(G/G_ref)^m with m from the field below). It raises the burn rate where the port gas mass flux G is high, so it changes the start of the thrust curve, the peak pressure and the burn time. Source selector: "Catalogue" uses the value calibrated in the propellant record (this box is then read-only and shows the value the solver used after Calculate); "My value" sends this number and the solver applies it. Blank in "My value" mode: nothing is sent and the catalogue value is used. Accepted range 0-1.',
