            'solid.ui.end_burner': 'End Burner',
            'solid.ui.energy_released_per_unit_mass_during': 'Heat of combustion ΔHc (kJ/kg) - informational only: no calculation reads it (the solver lists it under unwired_inputs "informational"); c* and T_c come from the selected catalogue record and NASA CEA at the motor chamber pressure. The catalogue has no ΔHc for any propellant, so picking a record clears this box unless you typed your own value. Blank: nothing is sent and no result changes. The box accepts 500-10000 kJ/kg; the solver does not use it.',
            'solid.ui.environmental_temperature_affecting_propellant_b': 'Ambient air temperature in K for the case heat-transfer and structural temperature checks (outer convection). It does NOT change the burn rate, thrust, burn time or Isp - the grain temperature is the Initial Temperature field (measured on the KNDX example: +20 K changes only thermal/structural results). Blank: the solver\'s reference ambient 298 K (SOLID_THERMAL). Accepted range 180-340 K (the server value gate rejects anything outside it by name).',
            'solid.ui.environmental_wind_speed_for_flight_trajectory': 'Environmental wind speed for flight trajectory calculations. Affects rocket stability and trajectory but not motor performance. Used for launch safety analysis.',
            'solid.ui.erosion_factor': 'Erosion Factor',
