            'solid.ui.final_dry_mass_kg_help': 'Vehicle mass after burnout (kg), sent as final_mass. After a motor calculation it is filled with the solver\'s dry mass (design_summary.masses.dry_mass_kg) unless you typed a value; add airframe and payload to both masses to fly a real vehicle. Empty or not a number: the field is not sent and the trajectory endpoint refuses the run, naming the field (no value is assumed).',
            'solid.ui.finocyl': 'Finocyl',
            'solid.ui.fraction_of_chamber_pressure_the_igniter': 'Fraction of chamber pressure the igniter must reach in the free volume before the grain takes over (NASA SP-8051 free-volume criterion). This is a design choice, not a computed value; it sets the igniter charge mass.',
            'solid.ui.igniter_pressure_fraction': 'Igniter Target Pressure',
