            'solid.ui.number_of_bolts_holding_each_closure': 'Number of bolts holding each closure against chamber pressure. Leave empty if unknown - the joint is then reported as "not sized" instead of guessed. Drives the separation and proof safety factors of the closure joint.',
            'solid.ui.parachute_area_m2': 'Parachute Area (m2)',
            'solid.ui.parachute_area_m2_help': 'Projected (canopy) area of the recovery parachute (m²), sent as parachute_area; descent speed scales as 1/√area. Empty: not sent — the solver uses its assumption of 2.0 m² and marks it as assumed in the results.',
            'solid.ui.parachute_cd': 'Parachute Cd',
