            'solid.ui.slot_depth': 'Slot Depth',
            'solid.ui.slot_depth_tooltip': 'Radial depth measured from the port wall. Deep slots reach the case early and make the curve regressive; shallow slots stay progressive. Must remain inside the available web.',
