            'solid.ui.nozzle_throat_and_expansion_section': 'Nozzle throat and expansion section',
            'solid.ui.nozzle_throat_diameter_critical_parameter_that': 'Nozzle throat diameter - critical parameter that determines chamber pressure and mass flow rate. Smaller throat = higher pressure. Must be sized for desired pressure and thrust.',
