            'solid.ui.pressure_sensitivity_exponent_in_burn_rate': 'Pressure sensitivity exponent in burn rate law r=a×P^n. Values 0.2-0.8 typical. Low n (0.2-0.4) gives stable combustion. High n (0.6+) can cause pressure instability. KN-sugar plateau/mesa regimes can have NEGATIVE n (burn rate drops with pressure) — this is physical, from published fits.',
            'solid.ui.pressure_sensor_range': 'Pressure Sensor Range',
            // Faz 6 / T49-yan (3 Ağustos 2026): iki ipucu da "Usually inhibited
            // to prevent forward/aft burning" diyordu, yani kutuların
            // VARSAYILANININ TERSİNİ öneriyordu (kutular işaretsiz gelir ve
            // motorun kendi varsayılanı da uçlar açık: solid_rocket_engine.py
            // 1413-1415). Ölçüldü (BATES, 100/30/500 mm, 3 segment, APCP):
            //   uçlar AÇIK + dış KAPLI  -> neutral      (Kn 160,6 -> 163,8, +%2,0)
            //   uçlar KAPLI + dış KAPLI -> progressive  (Kn 161,9 -> 242,1, +%49,5)
            //   uçlar KAPLI + dış AÇIK  -> regressive   (Kn 149,4 -> 113,1, -%24,3)
            // Metin artık nötr yanmanın NEDEN uçların açık kalmasını gerektirdiğini
            // söylüyor ve kaplamayı bilinçli bir tercih olarak sunuyor.
            'solid.ui.prevents_burning_on_aft_end_face': 'Prevents burning on the aft end face. In a BATES stack the end faces are left EXPOSED: the growing core area and the shrinking end area cancel, and that is what makes the burn neutral (measured on the default grain: Kn 160.6 -> 163.8, +2.0%). With the outer surface inhibited, coating both ends turns the curve progressive (Kn 161.9 -> 242.1, +49.5%) — tick this only if you want that.',
            'solid.ui.prevents_burning_on_forward_end_face': 'Prevents burning on the forward end face. In a BATES stack the end faces are left EXPOSED: the growing core area and the shrinking end area cancel, and that is what makes the burn neutral (measured on the default grain: Kn 160.6 -> 163.8, +2.0%). With the outer surface inhibited, coating both ends turns the curve progressive (Kn 161.9 -> 242.1, +49.5%) — tick this only if you want that.',
            'solid.ui.prevents_burning_on_outer_cylindrical_surface': 'Prevents burning on outer cylindrical surface. Usually inhibited for core-burning grains.',
