            'solid.ui.propellant_catalogue_record_help': 'The propellant identity sent to the solver (propellant_type): grain mechanics, two-phase loss, burn-rate regime table and the NASA CEA composition all come from this catalogue record. Changing it loads the record into the form, switches the Burn Rate Preset to this propellant\'s preset (or to Custom with the record\'s a-n pair when it has none) and keeps only the fields you typed yourself. The line below states the record\'s basis (validated or not, c* basis) and source. "Not selected" appears only for a project saved before v3.0.5 whose file does not name a catalogue record; the solver then derives the identity from the name and says so in the warnings.',
            'solid.ui.propellant_not_selected': 'Not selected (derived from the name by the solver)',
