            'solid.ui.reference_area_m2_help': 'Drag reference area (m²), sent as reference_area. After a motor calculation it is filled with the motor case outer cross-section π(D/2)² (cad_design.case_design.outer_diameter) unless you typed a value. Empty or not a number: the field is not sent and the trajectory endpoint refuses the run, naming the field (no value is assumed).',
            'solid.ui.relative_humidity_of_ambient_air_affects': 'Relative humidity of the ambient air (%) - informational only: no calculation reads it in this version (the solver lists it under unwired_inputs "informational"; measured: changing it changes no result). Moisture uptake of hygroscopic KN propellants during storage is not modelled. Blank: nothing is sent.',
