            'solid.ui.total_mass_excluding_propellant_case_nozzle': 'Motor dry mass (kg): sum of the motor component fields above (case + nozzle + insulation + liner + closures, the closure field including igniter and mounting). With the fields as filled by the solver it equals the solver motor dry mass. Avionics are a VEHICLE item, NOT part of the motor, and are not included. Output only: not used by the solver. The reconciliation table below compares it with the solver, component by component.',
            'solid.ui.total_mass_of_solid_propellant_automatically': 'Total mass of solid propellant. Automatically calculated from grain geometry and propellant density. Critical for performance calculations and thrust-to-weight ratio.',
